            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Limelite NoGA"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Halved the sprouts and \"stir-fried\" about 2-3 minutes, then turned off the heat, covered, and let them finish. They caramelized to tasty perfection and were delicious served with easy pan-fried tilapia flavored with 5-spice powder (recipe on allrecipes). I'm a fish fan and will be making this over and over again as the dish received thumbs up all around the table.",
