            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jeanne"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy and delicious! I agree with other reviewers that the sprouts needed longer to soften. Also, I caramelized half an onion (low heat) in the butter/oil first, then raised the heat to add the brussel sprouts.",
